This project is an MCP adapter over the language server from al-code-outline
(https://github.com/anzwdev/al-code-outline), Copyright (c) 2017 Andrzej
Zwierzchowski, licensed under the MIT License.

All AL parsing, analysis and code transformation logic belongs to that project.
This repository contains only the MCP protocol adapter, tool definitions, diff
generation, and process lifecycle management.

At runtime the language server loads Microsoft.Dynamics.Nav.CodeAnalysis from an
installed Microsoft AL Language extension (ms-dynamics-smb.al). Those assemblies
are Microsoft's and are neither redistributed nor modified by this project.
